  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Weza Large-Scale Rural Electrification Utility Feasibility Study, through National Rural Electric Cooperative Association</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Grant to Weza Power SU funds a feasibility study to assess the technical, economic, and financial viability, as well as set up the structure for the multi-phased implementation of a rural electric utility in Burundi. When fully implemented, the project would connect up to 2 million new households to electricity.</narrative>
  </description>
